	(text "MCU is now TI M0G3519QRHBRQ1 (MSPM0G3519-Q1). NRST MUST be pulled to VDD (R21/C40) --\nunlike the parts it replaces, this device will not leave reset otherwise. VCORE needs its own\n0.47uF tank cap (C39) and must not be connected to anything else. VREF+ is fed from\nVDDA-FILTRADO (C4 = 1uF is the required VREF decoupling). Security: AESADV-256 (GCM/CMAC),\nKEYSTORE (4 keys), CSC secure boot, flash firewalls, monotonic counter, TRNG -- this fully\nreplaces the S32K144 CSEc that was dropped. See PCB/MSPM0G3519-MCU-swap.md."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 317.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.5113)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c5bbf9b7-adff-4681-a6f5-5c726d580bb0")
	)
